  "created": "2026-10-30T03:07:43.51Z",
  "description": "A caching reverse proxy for the Git LFS HTTP API. Relays every Batch API call upstream so upstream remains the sole authority on access, rewrites the returned transfer URLs to point at itself, and serves object bytes from a local content-addressed store. A cache miss is fetched from upstream once and stored on the way through, so the next request for that object is local. Ships as a dotnet tool and as a container image for Kubernetes.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "ktsu.GitLfsCache.Tool",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-30T03:10:58.41Z",
